<!--
id: T12
name: Enterprise inquiry received
layout: base
kind: transactional
sender: hi
category: account
topic: none
trigger: enterprise_inquiry_submitted
phase: 1
subject: Thanks for your interest in Hydrilla for teams
preheader: We've got your details. You can also book a demo.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because you sent an enquiry about Hydrilla for teams.
optional: false
facts: do not promise a reply time until the team agrees one
data: name, company
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ trigger.name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>Thanks for your interest in Hydrilla{% if trigger.company %} for {{ trigger.company | default: "" | replace: "<", "&lt;" | replace: ">", "&gt;" }}{% endif %}. We've received your details and someone from the team will be in touch.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you'd rather talk it through now, you can pick a time that suits you.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://cal.com/hydrilla">Book a demo</mj-button>
